utput<openparen><closeparen><space>method.<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>The<space>initial<space>feature<space>argument<space>is<space>a<space>placeholder<space>and<space>can<space>be<space>ignored.<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote><quote><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>newFeature<space>=<space>fmeobjects.FMEFeature<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.pyoutput<openparen>newFeature<closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>close<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote><quote><quote>This<space>method<space>is<space>called<space>at<space>the<space>end<space>of<space>the<space>class.<quote><quote><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>pass<lf> }    OUTPUT { PYOUTPUT FEATURE_TYPE PythonCreator_OUTPUT        @SupplyAttributes(?,fme_feature_type,PythonCreator)         }
