pace><space>res<space>=<space>session.get<openparen>url<comma><space>timeout=10<comma><space>verify=False<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>res.ok:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>content<space>=<space>res.json<openparen><closeparen>.get<openparen><apos>content<apos><comma><space><openbracket><closebracket><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>content:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>data<space>=<space>content<openbracket>0<closebracket><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>data.pop<openparen><apos>links<apos><comma><space>None<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>data<openbracket><apos>stationId<apos><closebracket><space>=<space>station_id<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space><apos>date<apos><space>in<space>data<space>and<space><apos>measurementDate<apos><space>not<space>in<space>data:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>data<openbracket><apos>measurementDate<apos><closebracket><space>=<space>data<openbracket><apos>date<apos><closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>data<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>except:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>None<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>None<lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>input<openparen>self<comma><space>feature<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Pobranie<space>listy<space>ID<space>stacji<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>ids<space>=<space><openbracket><closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>t<space>in<space><openbracket><apos>WEATHER<apos><comma><space><apos>RAIN<apos><closebracket>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>try:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>r<space>=<space>requests.get<openparen>f<apos><opencurly>self.API_BASE<closecurly><solidus>observationStation?active=true<amp>size=10000<amp>type=<opencurly>t<closecurly><apos><comma><space>timeout=20<comma><space>verify=False<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>r.ok:<space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>ids.extend<openparen><openbracket>x<o