ce>id_stacji<space>=<space>str<openparen>feature.getAttribute<openparen><apos>id_stacji<apos><closeparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>url<space>=<space>f<quote>http:<solidus><solidus>meteor.iung.pulawy.pl<solidus>data2.php?s=<opencurly>id_stacji<closecurly><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>try:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>response<space>=<space>self.session.get<openparen>url<comma><space>timeout=10<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>response.status_code<space>==<space>200:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>text<space>=<space>response.text<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Parsowanie<space>daty<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>match_data<space>=<space>self.re_data.search<openparen>text<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>match_data:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen><quote>data_pomiaru<quote><comma><space>match_data.group<openparen>1<closeparen><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Helpery<space>do<space>wyci<u0105>gania<space>warto<u015b>ci<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>def<space>get_val<openparen>key<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>m<space>=<space>re.search<openparen>rf<apos><opencurly>key<closecurly>:<backslash>s*<openparen>-?<openbracket><backslash>d<backslash>.<closebracket>+<closeparen><apos><comma><space>text<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>float<openparen>m.group<openparen>1<closeparen><closeparen><space>if<space>m<space>else<space>None<lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>def<space>get_last_series<openparen>key<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>key<space>not<space>in<space>text:<space>return<space>None<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>try:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>fragment<space>=<space>text.split<openparen>f<apos><opencurly>key<closecurly>:<apos><closeparen><openbracket>1<closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>key<space>==<space><apos>temperature<apos>:<space>fragment<space>=<space>fragment.split<openparen><apos>humidity<apos><closeparen><openbracket>0<closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>key<space>==<space><apos>humidity<apos>:<space>fragment<space>=<space>fragment.split<openparen><apos>yaxis<apos><closeparen><openbracket>0<closebracket><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>matches<space>=<space>re.findall<openparen>r<apos><backslash><openbracket><openparen><backslash>d+<closeparen><comma><backslash>s*<openparen>-?<openbracket><backslash>d<backslash>.<closebracket>+<closeparen><backslash><closebracket><apos><comma><space>fragment<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>float<openparen>matches<openbracket>-1<closebracket><openbracket>1<closebracket><closeparen><space>if<space>matches<space>else<space>None<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>except:<space>return<space>None<lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Mapowanie<space>warto<u015b>ci<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>val_map<space>=<space><opencurly><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>temp<quote>:<space>get_last_series<openparen><apos>temperature<apos><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>temp_5cm<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>t5Int<quote><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>temp_g<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>tg10Int<quote><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>wilg<quote>:<space>get_last_series<openparen><apos>humidity<apos><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>wind_dir<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>windDir<quote><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>wind_gust<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>windSpeed<quote><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>rain_today<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>rainT<quote><closeparen><comma><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote>rain_yesterday<quote>:<space>get_val<openparen><quote>rainY<quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><closecurly><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>k<comma><space>v<space>in<space>val_map.items<openparen><closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen>k<comma><space>float<openparen>v<closeparen><space>if<space>v<space>is<space>not<space>None<space>else<space>None<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>else:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen><quote>_error<quote><comma><space>f<quote>HTTP<space><opencurly>response.status_code<closecurly><quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>except<space>Exception<space>as<space>e:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen><quote>_error<quote><comma><space>str<openparen>e<closeparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>return<space>feature<lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>close<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.logger.logMessageString<openparen>f<quote>Rozpoczynanie<space>pobierania<space>dla<space><opencurly>len<openparen>self.features<closeparen><closecurly><space>stacji...<quote><comma><space>fmeobjects.FME_INFORM<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>with<space>ThreadPoolExecutor<openparen>max_workers=self.max_workers<closeparen><space>as<space>executor:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>processed_feature<space>in<space>executor.map<openparen>self.fetch_data<comma><space>self.features<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.pyoutput<openparen>processed_feature<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.session.close<openparen><closeparen> }    PY_OUTPUT_TAGS { PYOUTPUT <Rejected> }    OUTPUT { PYOUTPUT FEATURE_TYPE PythonCaller_5_OUTPUT         }    OUTPUT { <Rejected> FEATURE_TYPE PythonCaller_5_<Rejected>         }
